= \\(\\frac{5 \\text{ feet}}{2 - \\frac{2}{5}} = \\frac{5}{\\frac{18}{5}} = \\frac{25}{18}\\) minutes.\n\n9. **Adding both times:**\n   - Total time needed = \\( \\frac{10}{2 - \\frac{2}{5}} \\) + \\(\\frac{25}{18}\\) = \\( \\frac{10\\pi \\cdot 5}{15} + \\frac{5\\cdot 50}{18} \\) = \\(15\\pi + \\frac{25}{9}\\).\n\nThe total time to fill the tank is \\(\\boxed{15\\pi + \\frac{25}{9}}\\) minutes.",
